'''Nyanko Village Cat''' (にゃんこ村のネコ, ''Nyanko Mura no Neko'', '''Nyanko Village Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy. It was added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Nyanko Village Cat
|image = E 773.png
|first appearance = [[Puzzle Bonanza! Nyanko Village Collaboration Event#Puzzle Bonanza! Nyanko Village|Puzzle Bonanza! Nyanko Village]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
A Village Cat sporting decent health, mediocre chance of explosion, and a 30% to freeze cats for 4 seconds, just barely getting past a 50% uptime, overall not a threatening enemy in any of their appearances unless you're a newbie.

==Strategy==
Just spam Wall Cats and some attackers as much as you can, their damage is too low to be harmful and they can be rushed easily, since almost all their appearances have them at a very low magnification, and their freeze is a small roadblock.

